# ⚠️ Two things are left out on purpose, and this file is where the reason is
#    written down: a blank is not neutral.
#
# `build/`  — the output of `idf.py build`. It is 34 MB of object files and it
#             is rebuilt from the two tracked inputs below.
# `sdkconfig` — generated by `idf.py build` from `sdkconfig.defaults`, and
#             rewritten on every configure. ⛔ The tracked thing is the
#             *defaults*, because that is the decision; a diff in the generated
#             copy is the build restating the defaults, and it reads in review
#             as though the intent changed when it did not.
#
# ⛔ What is NOT ignored: `partitions.csv` (the vendor's table, byte for byte)
#    and `sdkconfig.defaults` (the two measurements and the choices).
build/
sdkconfig
